          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I return or exchange items?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes you can. If you need to return or exchange your item, please notify us within <strong>7 days</strong> of when you received your package so we can start the process. If you do not let us know within the 7-day time frame, then, unfortunately, we cannot accept your return/exchange.</p>"
