            "answer": "<p>We believe that fashion should be accessible to everyone! We value quality in the manufacturing process of all of our garments and footwear. This means that we invest in high-quality machinery and also care about the life-work balance of our sewers and employees. All items must meet our quality standards before sent out so we can continue to be proud of our work and feel good about it! </p>"
